# 25,000 cards on a strip scrolled by the agent (a wheel on x), then the
# feed's rows with their own strips and inboxes (LLP 1070), scrolled down and
# back: each list builds what shows and keeps what its rows left.
wheel strip 0 700
wheel strip 0 3000
wheel strip 0 -1500
tap feed-page
wheel feed 1500
wheel strip-10 0 800
wheel feed 2500
wheel feed -1200
wheel feed -5000
